        <mxCell id="s6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#78A8D8;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[Component] Stage 6 — Field Enrichment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Source: BRD §6 (IDM/EDM) · BRD §7 (MIC)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Fires after Phase D. PF events only.&lt;br/&gt;NPF events SKIP Stage 6 entirely.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Re-derives IDM (F57) — BRD §6.&lt;br/&gt;Re-derives EDM (F59) — BRD §6.&lt;br/&gt;Day 1: IDM = EDM = Trader.&lt;br/&gt;Day 2 (legal pending): Sales = EDM.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Re-derives MIC (F36) — BRD §7.&lt;br/&gt;Soft-link: carry MIC + TVTI if blank.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;All carry-over in JSON DSL layer.&lt;br/&gt;UPDATE RDH_PERSISTENCE: IDM · EDM · MIC." vertex="1">
