        <mxCell id="e121n" edge="1" parent="1" source="d12cat" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#707070;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#707070;fontSize=10;" target="s1211" value="NPF">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e121p" edge="1" parent="1" source="d12cat" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#707070;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#707070;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="s1212" value="PF / NRPT">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;KEY RULES (Stage 2 — Kear call confirmed)&lt;/b&gt;  1. Every Kafka event creates a NEW ROW in BOTH tables (incl. NPF, replay) — Kear confirmed.  2. Replay: new row written with REPLAY_FLAG=Y, same MIFID_LINK_ID, skip Steps 1.0–2.0.  3. NPF: new row, same MIFID_LINK_ID + TRN carried. Persistence row inserted with carry-forward values.  4. PF/NRPT: new MIFID_LINK_ID, new TRN, new Persistence row.  5. ROOT_LINK_ID = first event MIFID_LINK_ID — new column — Kear confirmed for audit trail + sequencing.  6. MIFID_ACTION = NULL after Stage 2. 7. One vs multiple linkage tables (regime-specific): ⚠ open action on Kear (A1)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="900" x="250" y="1350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bpc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#0F4C81;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F4C81;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;  Phase C — Delta Check (BRD 5.1 + Kear DELTA_WF_FINAL)&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="810" width="1790" x="1350" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pc_lbl" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#78A8D8;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="[Aggregator] Phase C — Delta Check  &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A148C;&quot;&gt;⚡ CORRECTED (Kear call): Step 1 = Compare ALL fields (shared for YF + YE). Step 2 = DELTA_TYPE decides what to DO with result — not which fields to compare. N = skip comparison entirely.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="1520" x="1440" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ph_c" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#78A8D8;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[Aggregator] Phase C — Delta Check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Source: BRD 5.1 + Kear DELTA_WF_FINAL + Kear design call&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONFIRMED (Kear call):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 1: Compare ALL reporting fields&lt;/b&gt; — always run for both YF and YE.&lt;br&gt;Both YF and YE perform the &lt;b&gt;same full field comparison&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Compare against: MIFID_REPORTING_TABLE via TRN lookup.&lt;br&gt;Check A: Quantity delta (INT_RPT_QTY vs CURRENT_QTY).&lt;br&gt;Check B: All reporting fields vs previous version.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 2: DELTA_TYPE decides what to DO with the result&lt;/b&gt; — not which fields to compare.&lt;br&gt;DELTA_TYPE sourced from LCE enrichment (MX3 Events Sheet Col Y) — NOT a DB column." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="400" x="1395" y="1010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bpd" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#0F4C81;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F4C81;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;  Phase D — Submission State (Kear EXGESTER_WF_FINAL — restructured)&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="870" width="1780" x="1350" y="1740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pd_lbl" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#78A8D8;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[Aggregator] Phase D — Submission State Management&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;branches by ACTION first, then previous status&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 12px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;Source: Kear EXGESTER_WF_FINAL (18 Jun 2026) · Branches by current Reporting Action (CANC / REPL / NEWT), then checks previous version status against MIFID_REPORTING_TABLE in sequence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="1100" x="1430" y="1780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="db_bnd" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#0F4C81;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F4C81;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;" value="  &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;SHARED DATA LAYER" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="3030" x="220" y="2710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dtl_o" parent="1" style="shape=cylinder;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[DB] RDH_TRADE_LINEAGE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Written by: Stage 2 (every event inc. replay).&lt;br&gt;Stores: MIFID_LINK_ID (PK), PARENT_LINK_ID,&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ROOT_LINK_ID&lt;/b&gt; (= first event in full lifecycle),&lt;br&gt;IS_NRPT, IS_PREMIFID, MIFID_EVENT, MESSAGE_ID,&lt;br&gt;MX_CONTRACT_ID, MX_CREATOR_CONTRACT_ID,&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;REPLAY_FLAG&lt;/b&gt; (Y/N — distinguishes replay rows).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: rgb(204, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;⚠ Action: Add ROOT_LINK_ID · Action: Add REPLAY_FLAG&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="700" x="260" y="2750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dps_o" parent="1" style="shape=cylinder;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[DB] RDH_PERSISTENCE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Written by: Stage 2 (ALL events — every Kafka event&lt;br&gt;creates a new row, including NPF and replay).&lt;br&gt;Purpose: cache of carried-forward ARM-reportable field&lt;br&gt;values — enriched via MXML layer (not direct DB lookup).&lt;br&gt;Phase A reads PENDING. Phase C reads current values.&lt;br&gt;Phase D sets MIFID_ACTION. Stage 6 updates IDM/EDM/MIC.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT used as delta comparison source&lt;/b&gt; — delta&lt;br&gt;comparison is done against MIFID_REPORTING_TABLE.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px; color: rgb(230, 81, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;⚠ DELTA_TYPE is NOT a column here (LCE enrichment only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="740" x="1010" y="2750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mtt" parent="1" style="shape=cylinder;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[DB] MIFID_REPORTING_TABLE (Outbound)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Kear confirmed: this IS the outbound table — stores all&lt;br&gt;eligible trades sent or to-be-sent for ARM batch processing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase C delta comparison source&lt;/b&gt; — lookup by TRN.&lt;br&gt;If TRN not found → brand new (no delta needed).&lt;br&gt;If TRN found → compare vs latest reported version.&lt;br&gt;Phase D reads + writes — insert-only, new record per event.&lt;br&gt;Statuses: PENDING, SENT, OBSOLETE, FAIL.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="740" x="1760" y="2750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aud" parent="1" style="shape=cylinder;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;[DB] RDH_AUDIT_DELTA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Written by: Phase C (1 row per field compared).&lt;br&gt;IS_ECONOMIC_FIELD (Y/N), DELTA_OCCURRED (Y/N).&lt;br&gt;Regulatory evidence only — not read by pipeline.&lt;br&gt;Source: BRD 5.1.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="700" x="2510" y="2750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;KEY DESIGN DECISIONS + RULES — Updated from Kear call + DELTA_WF_FINAL + EXGESTER_WF_FINAL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/b&gt; 1. Every event (PF, NPF, NRPT, Replay) inserts new row in BOTH RDH_TRADE_LINEAGE and RDH_PERSISTENCE — no exceptions. 2. NPF: carry same MIFID_LINK_ID, new row, update event label + timestamp.  3. Replay: new row in both tables with REPLAY_FLAG=Y + same LINK_ID.  4. ROOT_LINK_ID: new column in LINEAGE = MIFID_LINK_ID of very first event in lifecycle — used for full audit trail + sequencing.  5. MIFID_ACTION = NULL after Stage 2. Stage 3 sets.  &lt;b&gt;Stage 3 Phase C:&lt;/b&gt; 6. Delta comparison is against MIFID_REPORTING_TABLE (outbound) using TRN as lookup key — NOT against PERSISTENCE.  7. Full delta (YF) AND Economic delta (YE) BOTH compare ALL reporting fields — same comparison process.  8. DELTA_TYPE decides what to DO with the result: YF = report out if ANY field changed; YE = report if economic field changed, suppress if only non-economic changed.  DELTA_TYPE is NOT about which fields to compare — it is about how to act on the result.  9. Economic vs non-economic tags held in a static rules/reference table.  10. Persistence field enrichment happens in MXML layer — not in JSON DSL layer.  &lt;b&gt;Architecture:&lt;/b&gt; 11. MIFID_REPORTING_TABLE is the single outbound table. Enriched field values flow through MXML layer into this table.  ⚠ Open actions: A1 (one vs multiple linkage tables — Kear), A7 (economic field list — Kear+Den), A9 (JSON table design — Sujeet+Pran+Vishali)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="3060" x="190" y="3020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgbnd" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#aaaaaa;strokeWidth=4;fontColor=#aaaaaa;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;" value="" vertex="1">
